        "item_key": "TS3004c#0",
        "type": "actions",
        "text": "The PM will supply five different front designs in a box."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3004c#1",
        "type": "decisions",
        "text": "The remote case should be hard plastic and transparent to enable backlighting."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3004c#2",
        "type": "problems",
        "text": "The remote will not wake up; the power light doesn't work and it appears it may have been turned off."
