        "type": "actions",
        "text": "UI will provide UI's design to the group."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3004c#6",
        "type": "problems",
        "text": "There is lack of information about the cost and viability of speech recognition, and discussions have been inconsistent."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3004c#7",
        "type": "actions",
        "text": "ID will discuss the material options with PM."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3004c#8",
        "type": "decisions",
        "text": "The Real Reaction logo will be placed on the remote, and the fronts on the remote should be replaceable."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3004c#9",
        "type": "actions",
        "text": "UI will paint prototype drawings on the smart board."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3004c#10",
        "type": "decisions",
